  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-tenant slug-based storefronts (one deployment, multiple businesses)",
    "Product variants with colors, sizes, and discount pricing",
    "Smart shopping cart with persistent state and variant selection",
    "WhatsApp-integrated one-click checkout flow",
    "Admin panel with full CRUD for products, banners, and settings",
    "Cloudinary image upload with automatic WebP compression",
    "Firebase Auth role-based access control for admin routes",
    "Izipay payment gateway integration",
    "Responsive layout for mobile, tablet, and desktop",
    "Go Router-based navigation with auth guards"
